      "side": 1,
      "message": "The spec doesn\u0027t really say if PR_Swaps are allowed in debug accessory mode. Assuming they are, I\u0027m thinking this should be UnorientedDebug.Src instead. (and upon entry we should apply Rp/Rp, and then in the future we can move to OrientedDebug.Src if we fix servo v4.x or whatever to have staggered pulldowns.)",
